[{"client_msg_id":"3ba7cd1f-14a8-46d4-b79d-f7c7fb48bc5a","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"そこらはさすがですね(確認しろよ)","ts":"1618487434.046600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"w2az"}]},{"client_msg_id":"1db399a7-9405-4256-b750-aabc472933b1","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"おー、なるほど...生かしますかねえ...","ts":"1618487413.046300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"1l=A"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d4e86cde-00bb-4343-92b9-b19ff5edaa1d","type":"message","user":"U6XP9LZ6V","text":"vimdoc-en の方は単一リポジトリなので GITHUB_TOKEN で行けそうですね","ts":"1618487324.045900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"uAUX"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f184bae0-e16b-4904-a26e-656df4014e6a","type":"message","user":"U6XP9LZ6V","text":"vimdoc-ja-working と vimdoc-en は別のキーです","ts":"1618487210.045200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"W5Rl"}]},{"client_msg_id":"777bf0e1-83d2-43a4-8d87-3bc8c862606d","type":"message","user":"U6XP9LZ6V","text":"専用のsshキーのはずです","ts":"1618487179.044700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"j8p"}]},{"client_msg_id":"bc513952-5ee2-491a-81ac-a78f78d7c8ce","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"で、いまさらsshキーもたす(しかもたぶんvim-jp共通の鍵になってつかいまわしてる)よりは特定レポにPAT払い出して、万が一はそのレポでつかってるtokenをrevokeする運用がラク\u0026amp;GHA向きなんじゃないかなーと考えて作ってます。\nただ、運用が不安だったので前出の疑問になったと。","ts":"1618487069.044200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Ya6w"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c561f25d-1219-4bee-b375-c84a8c4ba28e","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"いま、sshキーを暗号でもってるんですが...\nsyntax-vim-exは同一レポのなかの動きだったので苦はないんですが\nvimdoc-jpはvimdoc-jp-workingから生成してpushせんといかんので、おそらく","ts":"1618486917.042500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"LoA"}]},{"client_msg_id":"15c0c544-2999-4bef-96ca-4fc4ae1c2926","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"今どうなってるんだっけ","ts":"1618486799.041100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ylW"}]},{"client_msg_id":"6fee4cde-a83a-4080-a997-543ae35cd2f9","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"PAT がいるんですか?","ts":"1618486785.040900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"V1r9A"}]},{"client_msg_id":"be2742fd-d815-45dc-ac8c-1de3939c887e","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"テストは自前リポでがんばって確認しとくしかないな","ts":"1618486670.040700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"2Q2"}]},{"client_msg_id":"fb7b5a5a-f669-4003-a387-2c34997ec367","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"あー、いや、vimdoc-jpとvimdoc-jp-workingの対応だとリポが別なんで、PAT払出しが必須になりそう","ts":"1618486647.040400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"UWJ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b665a1d3-54f3-477e-8a87-291bd48f37f7","type":"message","user":"U6XP9LZ6V","text":"あとは、GITHUB_TOKEN の権限についてはこちら。フォークしたリポジトリからは読み取り権限はあるけど、書き込み権限はないと。 \u003chttps://docs.github.com/ja/actions/reference/authentication-in-a-workflow\u003e","ts":"1618486563.039600","attachments":[{"fallback":"ワークフローで認証する - GitHub Docs","id":1,"title":"ワークフローで認証する - GitHub Docs","title_link":"https://docs.github.com/ja/actions/reference/authentication-in-a-workflow","text":"GitHubは、GitHub Actionsの代理で認証を受けるために利用できるトークンを提供します。","blocks":null,"service_name":"docs.github.com","from_url":"https://docs.github.com/ja/actions/reference/authentication-in-a-workflow","original_url":"https://docs.github.com/ja/actions/reference/authentication-in-a-workflow"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"o0Y"}]},{"client_msg_id":"8b474607-0d9c-49f9-89c7-5cd5f93c71a7","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"うまい落し所なわけですね。なっとく。","ts":"1618486031.038300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"P6AMV"}]},{"client_msg_id":"00353e1b-7950-4fbd-93f4-98a801bcbfc2","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"どのリポジトリで走った、ではなく、どこからトリガーされたか、ですからね","ts":"1618485964.037900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"OVS"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4b99df6f-5175-40c0-8f00-a4da3c04cc88","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"あー、ならいいのか、では作りかけをすすめよう。\nありがとうございます \u003c@U6XP9LZ6V\u003e さん \u003c@U03C71D7H\u003e さん","ts":"1618485922.037500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"tY6hB"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e526f7ff-dc24-473e-83e1-aadb1b1cdca1","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"fork したリポジトリから出された PR だったら結局渡されないので別に大丈夫では?","ts":"1618485749.037000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"LCss"}]},{"client_msg_id":"6fed61c7-ce24-4c72-bce7-df1a876788e3","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"ああ、まあフォーク先はそうですよね\n気にしてるのはPRで、ですね\nmasterでしか動かないworkflowがあっても、PRにPRでも発動するように修正は作れちゃうから\nまあ気にしすぎてもしょうがないんですが","ts":"1618485597.036500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"gCLRg"}]},{"client_msg_id":"2da1acc5-9b7f-488e-a326-f4ca295a1fd9","type":"message","user":"U6XP9LZ6V","text":"\u0026gt; `GITHUB_TOKEN`を除き、フォークしたリポジトリからワークフローがトリガーされた場合、シークレットはランナーに渡されません。","ts":"1618485431.034900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ybhW"}]},{"client_msg_id":"3fda5d55-5c55-485e-848e-6283a7366de9","type":"message","user":"U6XP9LZ6V","text":"\u003chttps://docs.github.com/ja/actions/reference/encrypted-secrets#using-encrypted-secrets-in-a-workflow\u003e","ts":"1618485407.034500","attachments":[{"fallback":"暗号化されたシークレット - GitHub Docs","id":1,"title":"暗号化されたシークレット - GitHub Docs","title_link":"https://docs.github.com/ja/actions/reference/encrypted-secrets#using-encrypted-secrets-in-a-workflow","text":"暗号化されたシークレットを使うと、機密情報をOrganization、リポジトリ、あるいはリポジトリの環境に保存できます。","blocks":null,"service_name":"docs.github.com","from_url":"https://docs.github.com/ja/actions/reference/encrypted-secrets#using-encrypted-secrets-in-a-workflow","original_url":"https://docs.github.com/ja/actions/reference/encrypted-secrets#using-encrypted-secrets-in-a-workflow"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"EV6"}]},{"client_msg_id":"8250d0a0-1fde-40f3-8aca-b94430530810","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"自動付与されるのは、そのリポジトリ用で、うっかりPAT(Personal Access Token)にすると、そっちはプロジェクト全部横断的に使えるやつなんですよね(SSHとほぼ同じくらい?)\nsshもtokenも漏れたらその時点でプロジェクト全部に影響しちゃうから悩ましいなと。\n無効化はまあどっちも同程度簡単にできますが。","ts":"1618437023.034200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"nRD3Q"}]}]
